  name: June
  defaultMaterial: {fileID: 2100000, guid: b16a590c0ef80eb42a2e979228fb67b5, type: 2}
  ingredient: 5
  ingredientDislikes: 6
  skillOffer: 3
  skillNeeded: 4
  st01_ingredientText: Greeting, I came to give a few potatoes. Hope they can be
    of good use.
  st01_ingredientDislikeText: I cannot have anything spicy nowadays. Before that
    was my favourite, but times have changed.
  st01_skillOfferText: 'One thing I know well is the city. I can get you anywhere
    with my trusty car.  '
  st01_skillNeedText: I am getting ready for feedback session about a new law. One
    thing that can help is inviting more people, so catchy flyer could be of good
    use.
  st03_soupResultText: Good balance of flavour. I appreacite the meal.
  st03_skillOfferText: It's not much, but It would be my pleasure to help.
  st03_skillNeedText: The soup is great, but I have a huge issue where skill 04 would
    be convenient.
